<p>You surround yourself with a radius <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> distortion of gravity, knocking back and dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">47, 63, 75, 86, 95</acronym> physical damage to all creatures inside it.  The effect lasts <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns.  Deals 50% extra damage to pinned targets, in addition to the knockback.</p><p>The blast wave may hit targets more then once, depending on the radius and the knockback effect.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>